<title>USA: Compaq board sets cash tender for notes.</title>
<headline>Compaq board sets cash tender for notes.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compaq Computer Corp said Thursday its board of directors approved a cash tender offer for $150 million of its 6-1/2 percent senior notes due March 15, 1999, and $150 million of its 7-1/4 percent senior notes due March 15, 2004.</p>
</text>
